# Roblox Studio lock files, written next to a place while it is open.
*.rbxlx.lock
*.rbxlxm.lock

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# One-off patch/export artifacts. A 5 MB patch used to be tracked at the repo
# root; it is out of the index now, and this keeps new ones from being added.
*.patch
*.diff

# The CI workflow is written and lives in the working tree, but it cannot be
# pushed by the credential this checkout authenticates with: a GitHub App
# installation without the `workflows` permission is refused any commit that
# creates or updates .github/workflows/*, and GitHub rejects the whole push for
# it. Keep it local until a token with `workflows: write` is available, then
# `git add -f .github/workflows/ci.yml`.
.github/workflows/
